     "textwithimage": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "fileReference": "/content/dam/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/boards-modules/tq-systems/arm-modules/TQMa62xxL Embedded Cortex-A53 module%0A.jpeg",
      "imageRatio": "40",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "alt": "TQMa62xxL Embedded Cortex-A53 module",
      "text": "<h1>TI AM62xx for applications with enhanced computing &amp; scalable graphics performance</h1>\n<p>The TQMa62xxL Embedded Module, based on the Texas Instruments AM62xx processor family, delivers enhanced computing power and scalable graphics performance for a wide range of industrial applications. Featuring 4/2/1 Cortex A53 cores, this module provides flexible and scalable computing performance to meet diverse application requirements.</p>\n<p>With dual-display support for LVDS and RGB, as well as an optional 3D GPU, it offers versatile graphics capabilities. The LPDDR4 support with ECC ensures efficient and reliable memory performance, while integrated security functions enhance data protection.</p>\n<p>This module facilitates high-speed communication with 2x Gbit Ethernet switches with TSN support, 3 x CAN FD, and 2x USB 2.0 interfaces, making it suitable for demanding industrial applications. Despite its powerful performance, it maintains low power consumption, typically operating at just 2W.</p>\n<p>Designed with Texas Instruments' expertise, the TQMa62xxL module provides a seamless transition from the AM335x family, offering superior graphics, computing power, and industrial interfaces. It comes in a compact LGA form factor with various memory and storage options, making it an ideal choice for embedded systems in industrial automation, communication, and more.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 01:32:50 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
