      "text": "<table cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:154px;\"><p><b>TQMa6231L-AA</b></p>\n</td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>TQMa6231L-AA, Quad Cortex®- A53 / 1,4GHz, Cortex®- M4 / 400MHz, 1GB LPDDR4, 8GB eMMC, 64 kB EEPROM, RTC, -40°C...+85°C</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td style=\"width:154px;\"><p><b>TQMa6254L-AA</b></p>\n</td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>TQMa6254L-AA, Quad Cortex®- A53 / 1,4GHz, Cortex®- M4 / 400MHz, 1GB LPDDR4, 8GB eMMC, 64 kB EEPROM, RTC, with 3D GPU support, -40°C...+85°C</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr></tbody></table>",
